flowchart LR
    C[Customer voice or text] --> V[Voice layer\nBrowser SpeechRecognition]
    V -->|speech text| UI[Auralis Console\nindex.html · styles.css · app.js]
    UI --> API[FastAPI backend\nbackend/app.py]

    API --> S{Safety router}
    S -->|safe| G[LangGraph recovery workflow\nbackend/workflow.py]
    S -->|DNC / anger / human request| H[Human handoff\ncontext attached]
    S -->|callback later| CB[Save callback request\nend current call]
    S -->|sensitive payment topic| H

    G --> ST{Journey state}
    ST --> A[Consent]
    A --> B[Postcode]
    B --> D[Move-in date]
    D --> E[Energy profile\nNMI · usage · household · solar · EV]
    E --> F[Contact and concession]
    F --> P[Privacy consent]
    P --> J[Submit sandbox journey]

    G -->|next question| UI
    G -->|captured field| R[Right-side live signals\nprogress · confidence · guardrails]
    UI --> N[AI Call Notes\nauto-saved per lead]
    API --> DB[(conversations.json\nper-lead transcripts)]
    N --> DB

    API -. optional .-> O[Ollama Qwen3:8B\nLLM fallback]
    API -. optional .-> W[Faster-Whisper\nspeech-to-text]
    API -. optional .-> T[Piper\ntext-to-speech]
    T --> C
    UI -->|browser speech output| C

    classDef ui fill:#eaf4e4,stroke:#78a55f,color:#1e3024;
    classDef safety fill:#fff1df,stroke:#d39b4c,color:#4a3212;
    classDef data fill:#e9f1fb,stroke:#7197c2,color:#1d3048;
    class UI,R,N ui;
    class S,H,CB safety;
    class DB,O,W,T data;
